        { "id": "c_math_008_d", "label": "D", "text_en": "4", "is_correct": false }
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "solution_text_en": "Slope of tangent line is given by dy/dx. dy/dx = 3x^2 - 3. At x = 2: 3(2)^2 - 3 = 3(4) - 3 = 12 - 3 = 9.",
